# Chains

Purpose:
  Execution chains for SDDRA. Root D0 branches to arms; arms return to D0.
  Chain definitions: @INDEX.sdd
  Chain rules: @rules/chain-rules.sdd

Files:
  INDEX: @INDEX.sdd
  default: @default.sdd
  arms: @arms/
  rules: @rules/
  feature: @feature.sdd
  bugfix: @bugfix.sdd
  hotfix: @hotfix.sdd
  refactor: @refactor.sdd
  security: @security.sdd
  maintenance: @maintenance.sdd
  migration: @migration.sdd
  incident: @incident.sdd

State: +
